<title>USA: Travelers Group Inc unit sets $200 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Travelers Group Inc unit sets $200 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Commercial Credit Co, a unit of Travelers Group Inc, was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER COMMERCIAL CREDIT CO</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	 COUPON 6.20 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2001</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.753  FIRST PAY DATE 05/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD 6.258 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-PLUS    SPREAD 35 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
